            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>After having briefly explained what is meant by intervertebral manipulation, some clinical cases are considered and reviewed. Attention is called to the medical manipulation validity if performed by a skilled therapist and for particular diagnostic and symptomatic assumptions.</AbstractText>
